 C 2026 - Research/resource/in-use abstract deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Semantic Web Conference\nWebsit
 e: https://iswc2026.semanticweb.org/\nSource URL: https://iswc2026.semant
 icweb.org/importantdates\nLocation: Bari\, Italy\nTopics: Knowledge Repre
 sentation & Reasoning\, Graphs & Graph Learning\, Data Mining & Data Scie
 nce\, Information Retrieval & Search\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Paper-bas
 ed\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Semantic
