 nd Knowledge Management\nWebsite: https://cikm2026.diag.uniroma1.it/\nSou
 rce URL: https://cikm2026.diag.uniroma1.it/full-research-papers/\nLocatio
 n: Rome\, Italy\nTopics: Data Mining & Data Science\, Machine Learning\, 
 Natural Language Processing & LLMs\, Human-AI Interaction & Deployment\nS
 ize: XL\nSubmission type: Paper-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checke
 d date: 2026-10-28\nNotes: Official CIKM 2026 pages (rechecked 2026-10-28
 ) confirm Rome\, Nov 7-11 (tutorials/PhD symposium Nov 7\, workshops Nov 
 8\, main conference Nov 9-11) and AoE full-paper deadlines of May 16 (abs
 tract) and May 23. Short\, resource and demo papers had a separate May 30
 /June 6 cycle\, not tracked here.\nScope: Information retrieval\, knowled
 ge management\, data mining and database systems\, with a strong focus on
