SUMMARY:[Complex Systems & Network Science][Graphs & Graph Learning] COMPLE
 X NETWORKS 2026 - Extended abstract submission deadline (independent rout
 e)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Conference on Complex Networks 
 and Their Applications\nWebsite: https://complexnetworks.org/\nSource URL
 : https://complexnetworks.org/submission/\nLocation: Granada\, Spain\nTop
 ics: Complex Systems & Network Science\, Graphs & Graph Learning\, Nonlin
 ear Dynamics & Chaos\, Data Mining & Data Science\nSize: L\nSubmission ty
 pe: Paper-based + extended abstracts\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked
  date: 2026-10-08\nNotes: Main conference December 2-4\; tutorials Decemb
 er 1. Full papers appear in Springer Studies in Computational Intelligenc
 e\; extended abstracts in a separate abstract book. Abstracts are an inde
 pendent contribution\, not a prerequisite for full papers. Production cut
 off hours are unannounced. Size is an editorial estimate.\nScope: Structu
 re\, inference and dynamics of complex networks\, including community str
 ucture\, multilayer and temporal networks\, spreading processes\, graph l
 earning and network neuroscience. Network methods\, rather than a broad i
 nventory of every application\, characterize the meeting. Full papers and
  extended abstracts have separate publication outcomes.\nAdditional topic
 s: Time Series & Sequential Data\, Machine Learning\, Computational Neuro
 science\nScope sources (2026): https://complexnetworks.org/submission/\nS
 cope last checked: 2026-10-08
URL:https://complexnetworks.org/submission/
